<title>UK: Quebec sets 150 million stg 15-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Quebec sets 150 million stg 15-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   QUEBEC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    04.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.55	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+73 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    QUEBEC    HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.00 PCT GILT DUE 2011 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
